      "text": [
        "390 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَا مِنْ عَبْدٍ مُؤْمِنٍ يَغْسِلُ مَيِّتاً مُؤْمِناً وَ يَقُولُ وَ هُوَ يَغْسِلُهُ رَبِّ عَفْوَكَ عَفْوَكَ إِلاَّ عَفَا اَللَّهُ عَنْهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.390 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"There is no believing servant who washes a deceased believer and says while washing them:\nRabbi ‘afwuka ‘afwuka\n'O’ Lord (azj), Your forgiveness, Your forgiveness,' except that Allah (swt) forgives them.\""
        ]
      }
